--- !u!114 &654509258
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 654509255}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 827b4bd3e0001ca4c9bd6317fc8a1d15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcTalk
  npcName: Old Tacet
  lines:
  - Long ago the Archcantor tried to bind every voice in Cantoria into one endless,
    perfect chord.
  - Your teacher, the old Maestro, lowered his baton before the last note. The chord
    was never finished.
  - That unfinished chord is the Silence. It hungers for the note it never got.
  healsParty: 0
  talkRange: 4.4
